        <!-- Closing -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Masonry Defender is a credible line from a company with real chimney-trade experience, but the name covers two opposite chemistries. The Chimney Brick, All Purpose and Concrete Driveway sealers are breathable penetrating repellents. The Interior/Exterior Brick and Patio Paver sealers are acrylic films that add sheen and darken.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Pick the product for the surface, repair joints and crowns first, flood the wall at the full coverage rate with a wet-on-wet second coat, and register the warranty the day you apply. Done that way, the penetrating products are a reasonable value choice for most exterior brick.
          </p>
